// Malicious PowerShell Commandlets - ProcessCreation | T1059.001, T1069, T1069.001, T1069.002, T1087, T1087.001, T1087.002, T1482 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_powershell_malicious_cmdlets.yml
